Audit of lock correctness around blocking functions (no bugs found), plus mechanical C++17 modernization across the full codebase.

### `std::bind` → lambdas (69 call sites, 9 files)

All `std::bind(&Class::method, this, placeholders...)` replaced with generic lambdas. Parameters passed by `const auto &` to avoid unnecessary shared_ptr copies.

```cpp
// Before
std::bind(&UavManagerNode::onPx4Status, this, std::placeholders::_1)
// After
[this](const auto & msg) { onPx4Status(msg); }
```

### Chrono literals

Added `using namespace std::chrono_literals;` to all `.cpp` files and relevant headers. Replaced verbose constructions with literals where the value is a constant.

```cpp
// Before
std::chrono::milliseconds px4StatusTimeout{1000};
std::this_thread::sleep_for(std::chrono::milliseconds(20));
// After
std::chrono::milliseconds px4StatusTimeout{1000ms};
std::this_thread::sleep_for(20ms);
```

### `actionSlotReserved_`: mutex+bool → `std::atomic<bool>`

The single-flight action slot was guarded by a mutex for a simple test-and-set. Replaced with lock-free CAS via `compare_exchange_strong`. Removed `actionSlotMutex_` entirely.

```cpp
bool UavManagerNode::reserveActionSlot()
{
  bool expected = false;
  return actionSlotReserved_.compare_exchange_strong(expected, true);
}
```

### Lock correctness audit (no changes needed)

- `HealthAggregator::mutex_` — guards compound state (`optional<TimedPx4Status>`, etc.). Correctly requires mutex; not convertible to atomics.
- `UavManagerNode::mutex_` — guards multi-field FSM + cached status. Correct.
- No starvation or race conditions found.

### Structured bindings / `generate_parameter_library`

No tuple/pair unpacking patterns exist in the codebase — structured bindings not applicable. `generate_parameter_library` deferred (requires new build dep, YAML schemas, CMake refactoring).

