> **Note:** For Firebase to connect on Vercel, set `VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY`, `VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN`, `VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID`, `VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET`, `VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID`, and `VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID` in Vercel project environment variables.

